            <div class="field field--name-dynamic-block-fieldnode-scheda-cds-frequenza field--type-ds field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="views-element-container form-group"><div class="view view-w4-cdsi-to-node view-id-w4_cdsi_to_node view-display-id-block_10 js-view-dom-id-8f51f6302f2fb00908ae71db7eabde4b62aaada32135afaf1aed53d730038f06">
  
    
      
      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-field-frequenza"><div class="field-content">La frequenza è fortemente consigliata per tutti gli insegnamenti e obbligatoria per i laboratori.</div></div></div>

